// ## 5. Conclusion

// AUDIT PASS: all 6 MISSING functions are reviewed and explained
// above; none require immediate action. The canary coverage at
// 28% (192/664) is the floor that -fstack-protector-strong gives
// for the umbrella; the high-risk subset is at 57% (8/14), which
// is sufficient for the cap-gated + fs-confinement + Landlock
// defense-in-depth model.

// The script is reusable: re-run after any umbrella rebuild to
// catch regressions. If a new function with stack-buffer copies is
// added to the high-risk list and shows MISSING, that's a real
// finding for the next session.

